    "summary": "Qualify a calendar NuGet Codecs candidate from nine unchanged original sources using the exact privately published IR/Quantities dependency closure and fifteen compiled binary oracles, without publication.",
    "value": "Link nine original Codecs sources into a temporary package projection using one exact IR PackageReference, inspect the physical IR and Quantities archives and build a fresh fifteen-case source-free package consumer.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "After eight independently verified Math private packages, F1 selects Codecs as an unpublished source with one direct IR ProjectReference and a transitive Quantities project dependency.",
      "The package projection is disposable and retains original Codecs source Version 1.0.0-preview.8, nine C# source files, csproj and original two-project lockfile unchanged.",
      "No shared NUGET_LOCAL write, package reservation, public license, installed rollback, external repository mutation or AURA/Decision/Discovery integration occurs."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After durable RS161 candidate qualification, rehearse immutable Codecs publisher with exact IR and Quantities dependencies on a disposable feed before any owner release.",
